<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<WorkflowBuilder Version="2.9.0"
                 xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
                 xmlns="https://bonsai-rx.org/2018/workflow">
  <Description>ConditionedTaskLogs on ZapitDaq (TaskLogsZapitDaq in place of TaskLogs). A conditioned task's logs (its trials drawn from weighted trial conditions, OpenRigs.Trials IConditionedTask): Settings_Combinations, its one writer, every combination the conditions built at Go, each a row the trial log's trialCombinationId names (TrialRules.CombinationsJson, through LogDataSchema); and TaskLogsZapitDaq (Settings_Task from the input, WorkflowData_Trials, ZapitDaq's events), last, so the include's output is TaskLogsZapitDaq's and the combinations' write completing ends nothing. Needs what TaskLogsZapitDaq needs and TrialRules, the task's rules published at Go with a CombinationsJson member.</Description>
  <Workflow>
    <Nodes>
      <Expression xsi:type="SubscribeSubject">
        <Name>TrialRules</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="MemberSelector">
        <Selector>CombinationsJson</Selector>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:LogDataSchema.bonsai">
        <Name>Settings_Combinations</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="WorkflowInput">
        <Name>Source1</Name>
      </Expression>
      <Expression xsi:type="IncludeWorkflow" Path="OpenRigs.Logging:TaskLogsZapitDaq.bonsai" />
    </Nodes>
    <Edges>
      <Edge From="0" To="1" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="1" To="2" Label="Source1" />
      <Edge From="3" To="4" Label="Source1" />
    </Edges>
  </Workflow>
</WorkflowBuilder>
